{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Rain Sleep Sounds 是一款結合自然雨聲與人工智能的睡眠輔助 App，適合難以入睡、淺眠易醒或想建立規律作息的人。它提供自訂音景、沉浸式雨景影片、睡眠故事與冥想內容，並可配合 Apple Health 分析睡眠週期。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-34.webp\">\n<h2>自訂音景與 AI 睡眠分析</h2>\n<p>App 可把不同雨勢與白噪音、風聲自由疊加，調出專屬的聲音毛毯，配合高清雨景影片與可選旁白的睡眠故事，讓思緒慢慢安靜。內置 AI 睡眠助手以 Apple 裝置端模型運作，提供個人化睡眠建議，資料不會離開手機。同步 Apple Health 後可查看睡眠週期分析，另設夢境日記、冥想練習與睡眠科普文章。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-429-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-430-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-431-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-432-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-433-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-434-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Rain Sleep Sounds</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:02.617631+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:35:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:57:40.931127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:40.787990+00:00","content_hash":"6cc00ba75ec09bcf6d96730fdf100121c9a895e3ae8617e98d172dfe049df82d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}